35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime covers everything. We cannot promise new routes without breaking the existing schedule.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the pilots actually succeeded! The late-evening one hit its cost target. We have proof it works, so stop doubting the data.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ground is the real bottleneck. Three jobs stalled on unrecorded voids. We must price that risk, not just the schedule.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Takumi, the pilots worked, but the ledger shows our operating subsidy was trimmed again. We can’t afford the recurring costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
