40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, fixing connections is smart, but I have no spare crews to staff them. The maintenance contract has slack, but the drivers are exhausted.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the accessibility records show four lifts finished on time. We have the infrastructure. Stop hiding behind empty rosters and let us build.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
